       Berners-Lee, R. Fielding, and L. Masinter, August 1998.
       
       RFC 2368: "The mailto URL scheme", by P.Hoffman , L Masinter, J. Zawinski, July 1998.
       
       RFC 1808: "Relative Uniform Resource Locators", by R. Fielding, UC Irvine, June
       1995.
       
